# Allow-list: the build context is only what docker/Dockerfile COPYs — the
# root workspace manifests, the Rust crates, the agent host and docker/.
# Everything else (apps/*, the TypeScript bridge packages, vendor/, runtime
# data/, Rust target/, toolchains) is never read by the image, so it is never
# sent to the daemon or hashed.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/agent-host/
!packages/protocol/fixtures/
!docker/

# Inside the allowed trees: build output, deps, and tests. Tests are excluded
# so editing one never invalidates the image's build layers.
**/target
**/node_modules
**/out
**/dist
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/vitest.config.*
